<div class="tab-panel reveal" id="scheduling" role="tabpanel">
      <div>
        <h3>One pool, many sites</h3>
        <p>The scheduler treats every rack as part of a single on-demand pool.</p>
        <span class="lbl">How it places work</span>
        <ul>
          <li>Each copy lands on one server with enough free GPUs</li>
          <li>Copies of a deployment are spread across racks</li>
          <li>Rollouts replace one copy per pass and pause when a new version can't start</li>
          <li>Each buyer gets whole servers; nobody shares a machine</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
