    <div class="tab-panel reveal" id="gpu-health" role="tabpanel">
      <div>
        <h3>GPU health from NVIDIA DCGM</h3>
        <p>Every GPU reports its health continuously, and problems become alerts for our operators.</p>
        <span class="lbl">What we do with it</span>
        <ul>
          <li>GPU health alerts straight from DCGM telemetry</li>
          <li>When a server goes down, its copies are started on other servers automatically</li>
          <li>When a site goes offline, the pool shrinks instead of failing: its copies move to other sites</li>
          <li>All rack metrics are kept centrally for every site</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
