      <div>
        <h3>Security for untrusted places</h3>
        <p>A rack in a backyard has to protect itself.</p>
        <span class="lbl">Layers</span>
        <ul>
          <li>Immutable operating-system image on every server</li>
          <li>New racks register themselves and wait for an operator's approval</li>
          <li>Whole servers per buyer, on hardened Kubernetes</li>
          <li>Endpoints only answer requests carrying the buyer's API key</li>
          <li>Buyers can't override GPU driver settings from their containers</li>
        </ul>
